sequenceDiagram
    participant browser as React
    participant proxy as Vite or Nginx
    participant backend as NestJS
    participant ai as FastAPI
    participant model as Ollama
    participant vector as Qdrant
    browser->>proxy: POST /ai/generate/stream
    proxy->>backend: Forward prompt, messages, model
    backend->>backend: Validate DTO and create requestId
    backend->>ai: POST /generate/stream with request_id
    ai->>ai: Resolve configured provider and model
    ai-->>backend: NDJSON start
    backend-->>proxy: Pipe start
    proxy-->>browser: Start event
    ai->>ai: Acquire semaphore
    opt Qdrant retrieval enabled
        ai->>model: POST /api/embeddings
        model-->>ai: Query vector
        ai->>vector: SDK query_points with corpus filter
        vector-->>ai: Matching evidence
    end
    ai->>ai: Assemble bounded messages
    ai->>model: POST /api/chat with stream true
    loop Output chunks
        model-->>ai: Chat content
        ai-->>backend: NDJSON delta
        backend-->>proxy: Pipe delta
        proxy-->>browser: Append delta to assistant message
    end
    model-->>ai: Generation complete
    ai-->>backend: NDJSON done
    backend-->>proxy: Pipe done
    proxy-->>browser: Mark message complete
